  {
    "id": "55c6803f5c2b0cbd41e8",
    "source": "When violence breaks out, call start_encounter with the enemies involved BEFORE narrating the first hostile exchange (use the Enemy picks list or any 5e monster; rename freely to fit the world). Fights run on server-tracked enemies with real HP, never on imagined ones. For an ambush pass ambush with the side lying in wait: the server rolls the hiders' Stealth against each opponent's passive Perception and only those who notice nothing are surprised; pass surprised only when the story has already settled who is caught off guard. The server rolls the opening initiative for every character whose dice it rolls; call request_roll kind=initiative only for the characters the result still lists.",
    "sourceHash": "55c6803f5c2b0cbd41e838e95650290c7fc9d9f483136e2ab3daccfa63ef0113",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
